    "section_columns_fCHGtj": {
      "type": "section-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "image_TqWnyf": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2026-03-02_at_13.01.22.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Infinitum Entertainment Group",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p><strong>WORKSPACE | LONDON </strong></p><p><em>\"We had an excellent experience working with Simran Design Services on the design and fit-out of the Infinitum Entertainment & Creator office on Carnaby Street.<br/><br/>From the initial design concepts through to full project management, the team were exceptional. They managed the entire process seamlessly, coordinating all tradesmen, overseeing regulations and compliance, and making what could have been a stressful project feel easy and well organised throughout.<br/><br/>Their approach was highly collaborative - they really listened to what we wanted as a business and translated it into a space that feels creative, welcoming and functional. The attention to detail, communication and professionalism were outstanding from start to finish.<br/><br/>The final office space has completely transformed the way we work. It’s a space the whole team genuinely loves </em>being in every day, and we constantly receive compliments on the design.<br/><em><br/>We loved working with Simran and Shreya and would use them again in a heartbeat.\"</em></p><p>- F. Santoro</p>",
            "text_size": 2,
            "button_text": "READ THE 5* Google Review",
            "button_url": "https://g.co/kgs/fTfvh7d",
            "button_type": "btn--secondary",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "button_style": "btn--outline",
            "show_arrow": true
          }
        },
        "image_HRKdkq": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG-20220731-WA0014_00b2c3b0-2445-4f02-afc6-d0b606e866ea.webp",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "maptalent recruitment",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p><strong>WORKSPACE | DUBAI </strong></p><p><em>Simran has always been the best in what she does. Expect nothing but a high level of professionalism and unique talent from her. She gives full attention in listening and learning what the clients need, executes the plan properly and exceeds expectations. Our office in JLT, Dubai is stunning because of her and all our employees are just happy to call it “second home” She is highly recommended!</em></p><p></p><p>- A. Madaero</p>",
            "text_size": 2,
            "button_text": "READ THE 5* Google Review",
            "button_url": "https://g.co/kgs/fTfvh7d",
            "button_type": "btn--secondary",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "button_style": "btn--outline",
            "show_arrow": true
          }
        },
        "image_GCkihL": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/13.jpg",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "darbar arts & heritage trust",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p><strong>STUDIO, OFFICES, CAFE | LONDON </strong></p><p><em>Simran led the design brief for our Darbar Arts Works project in London - an arts hub for emerging musicians and the experience was excellent from start to finish. She's genuinely professional, an attentive listener who took the time to understand our vision, and she came back with creative, considered ideas that balanced ambition with a realistic budget. Rare to find someone who can translate a cultural brief into design so thoughtfully. Highly recommended.</em></p><p>- S. Virdee</p>",
            "text_size": 2,
            "button_text": "READ THE 5* Google Review",
            "button_url": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/4WrBwuyC2rfAffTSA",
            "button_type": "btn--secondary",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "button_style": "btn--outline",
            "show_arrow": true
          }
        },
        "image_gt7Djb": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot-2025-08-30-at-202416-1756581930.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "MERIDIAN personal training gym",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p><strong>GYM | LEICESTER </strong></p><p><em>Simran designed a gym for me to use to train clients daily, her drawings and ideas were first class. Communication was professional and a she has a great humble personality. Once drawings were agreed the quality of work was exceptional the finishing was outstanding. Work was completed at a fast rate. The imagination is truly a work of art. I fully recommend Simran to any one who wants design and implementation. Very happy with the outcome. You will not regret choosing her.</em></p><p>- M. Patel</p>",
            "text_size": 2,
            "button_text": "READ THE 5* Google Review",
            "button_url": "https://g.co/kgs/6vNLkm9",
            "button_type": "btn--secondary",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "button_style": "btn--outline",
            "show_arrow": true
          }
        },
        "image_U6FAtB": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-09-01_at_16.50.14.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Furniture Online HQ",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p><strong>GAMES ROOM BAR | LEICESTER </strong></p><p><em>We worked with Simran Design to create a chill-out room in our office and they did a fantastic job. The space has been transformed into a relaxing and stylish area that the team really enjoys. Simran and the team were professional, creative and easy to work with throughout. Highly recommend them for any office design projects.</em></p><p>- S. Majithia</p>",
