            "text": "<p><strong>HOSPITALITY UNIT | LEICESTER </strong></p><p><em>Simran Design were contracted to redesign our office space. The team listened to the brief of what we required and delivered a stunning design. They delivered above and beyond what was expected. I can not recommend them highly enough. They were a highly professional and motivated team which delivered a project within a very tight deadline.</em></p><p>- A. Madaero</p>",
