    "section_reviews_d7f7pB": {
      "type": "section-reviews",
      "blocks": {
        "review_KhQkAW": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "subheading": "Ultra Hair Clinic, Birmingham",
            "review_text": "Working with Simran Design LTD has been an exceptional experience from start to finish. From our very first consultation, Simran and her team demonstrated a true understanding of our vision, paired with a level of professionalism and expertise that immediately put us at ease.\n\nThey carried out a thorough and thoughtful assessment of our clinic space, taking into consideration not only aesthetics but also functionality, flow, and client experience. Their advice throughout was honest, knowledgeable, and clearly rooted in a deep understanding of design within a clinical setting.\n\nThe entire team was incredibly polite, warm, and welcoming at every interaction. Communication was seamless, timelines were adhered to, and every stage of the process was handled with efficiency and care. What truly stood out was their meticulous attention to detail, nothing was overlooked, and every element was carefully considered to create a cohesive and elevated finish.\n\nThe design plans were delivered promptly and with clarity, and Simran remained open and receptive to our feedback and ideas throughout. This collaborative approach made the journey not only smooth but genuinely enjoyable, as we felt fully supported and involved at every step.\n\nSimran herself brought such a positive energy to the project. Her passion, creativity, and commitment to excellence were evident throughout, and she guided us through each stage with patience, enthusiasm, and a genuine desire to achieve the very best outcome.\n\nWe are absolutely thrilled with the transformation of Ultra Hair Clinic. The space now embodies a luxurious, refined atmosphere that perfectly aligns with the premium service we strive to deliver. It has elevated not only the look and feel of the clinic but also the overall client experience.\n\nOur staff and clients alike have been incredibly complimentary! Everyone who walks through our doors immediately notices the difference. It is now a space we are truly proud of and love welcoming both new and returning clients into.\n\nWe cannot recommend Simran Design LTD highly enough. If you are looking for a team that combines creativity, precision, and professionalism with a truly personal touch, they are simply outstanding.",
            "featured_image": "shopify://shop_images/51.png",
            "review_url": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/i7f3efwAcjbPo8Aa9"
          }
        },
        "review_MjRbhc": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "A. Patel",
            "subheading": "Ahri Catering",
            "review_text": "Simran Design were contracted to redesign our office space. The team listened to the brief of what we required and delivered a stunning design. They delivered above and beyond what was expected. I can not recommend them highly enough. They were a highly professional and motivated team which delivered a project within a very tight deadline.",
