            "subheading": "Personal Trainer, UK",
            "review_text": "Simran designed a gym for me to use to train clients daily, her drawings and ideas were first class. Communication was professional and a she has a great humble personality.\n\nOnce drawings were agreed the quality of work was exceptional the finishing was outstanding. Work was completed at a fast rate. The imagination is truly a work of art.\n\nI fully recommend Simran to any one who wants design and implementation.\n\nVery happy with the outcome. You will not regret choosing her.",
