    "section_accordion_group_6BXJCK": {
      "type": "section-accordion-group",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_6mjaQp": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQ"
          }
        },
        "question_Gg3RBp": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What types of spaces do you design?",
            "content": "<p>Simran Design Ltd specialises in <strong>commercial interiors</strong> - including offices, cafés, salons, clinics, restaurants, wellness spaces, and hospitality venues. </p><p>We work with clients across the UK (and internationally via E-Design) to create environments that are functional, memorable, and brand-aligned.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_4PWQ7m": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What interior design services do you offer?",
            "content": "<p>We have various interior design packages that include the services below, and can be tailored according to your project. Some of the services we offer include:</p><ul><li>Space planning and CAD floor plan drawings (furniture layouts, lighting and electrical layouts)</li><li>Mood boards</li><li>Physical and Digital Material boards</li><li>Brand development</li><li>3D visualisations</li><li>Sourcing - furniture, lighting, accessories</li><li>Shopping Lists and a live client portal </li><li>Detailed drawings and handover documentation</li></ul>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_XpDpef": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "How much do your interior design services cost?",
            "content": "<p>After an initial discussion, we’ll email you a bespoke quotation with a scope of work, timeline and breakdown of costs - no guesswork or hidden fees.</p><p>Each design project is different, so we tailor our services and provide clear pricing based on the size and complexity of your space. </p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_An87CA": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "How long does an interior design project usually take?",
            "content": "<p>Timelines can vary depending on the size and scope of the project, but as a guide:</p><ul><li><strong>E-Design</strong> projects take approximately 2–4 weeks per space.</li><li><strong>Full-service interior design</strong> can take approximately 4-6 weeks for the design work, and 6–12+ weeks for design + installation, depending on complexity.</li><li><strong>Larger commercial fit-outs</strong> may take longer if structural works or planning approvals are needed.</li></ul><p>We’ll always provide you with a realistic schedule from the start and updates at each stage to keep your project moving efficiently. </p><p></p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_YVJXdx": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What is E-Design, and is it right for my business?",
            "content": "<p>E-Design is a <strong>remote interior design service</strong> delivered entirely online - ideal for clients who want expert input without full project management. </p><p>You'll receive mood boards, material boards, floor plans, sourcing/shopping lists, and 3D visualisations, depending on the level of detail you require - all professionally curated and ready to implement.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_e3bhHP": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Where do you take on design projects?",
            "content": "<p>We’re based in Leicester and take on commercial projects across the UK, with some past projects to date covering London, Birmingham, Manchester, Nottingham, and Cambridge and more.</p><p>Our E-Design services are remote and available <strong>globally </strong>- we have designed internationally, including offices in Dubai and clinics in Germany.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_zEzGJe": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Do you offer site visits and in-person consultations?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. We offer site visits for UK-based projects, location dependent, during the design process and installation phase. For international clients or remote projects, we offer detailed online consultations and support throughout your project.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_VPKBjP": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Can you organise the installation phase too?",
            "content": "<p>We design every detail, then work closely with trusted fit-out contractors to quote and execute the installation phase. </p><p>We also offer annotated drawings and material schedules to ensure seamless communication from concept to completion. </p><p>If you would like to organise the fit-out yourself, we can supply detailed plans for your contacts to execute the design work to completion.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_7hMWPT": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Can you work with a specific budget?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely. We aim to design with purpose, not excess. During our consultation, we’ll discuss your priorities and budget so we can propose a plan that fits your needs and delivers high impact. We will always be realistic in advising what you can achieve and can recommend a minimum budget if you are unsure. </p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_44B7k7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "I’m just starting out, can I still get in touch?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely. Whether you’re opening your first space, expanding or just refreshing your business, we’re happy to guide you. We can support you from design concept development right through to your final finishes.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        }
      },
